  "description": "A reusable .NET 8 class library that provides standardised Excel import\n      and export for any project. Supports ClosedXML (free default), EPPlus\n      (advanced features), and the Microsoft OpenXML SDK as interchangeable\n      engines via a single IExcelAccelerator interface.\n\n      Features: strongly-typed export/import, attribute-driven column mapping,\n      multi-sheet workbooks, import templates with dropdown validation, per-row\n      error reporting, conditional formatting, Excel Tables, formula totals,\n      cell comments, page setup, header/footer, and more.",
